WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.190
Three months. That's how long it took to

00:00:02.190 --> 00:00:04.260
turn my store around. I'm Charlie, by the

00:00:04.260 --> 00:00:04.880
way.

00:00:04.880 --> 00:00:08.580
Wolfden Supply, drop shipping, and print-on-demand.

00:00:08.580 --> 00:00:10.920
Look, I'm not a hype guy, so I'll just

00:00:10.920 --> 00:00:11.920
give you the facts.

00:00:11.920 --> 00:00:14.760
My store existed. It just didn't sell.

00:00:14.760 --> 00:00:16.960
That was the situation. These guys

00:00:16.960 --> 00:00:18.500
rebuilt the whole operation.

00:00:18.500 --> 00:00:21.390
Store products, the entire drop shipping,

00:00:21.390 --> 00:00:23.960
and POD flow done properly this time.

00:00:23.960 --> 00:00:27.080
Now, orders come in daily. Store actually

00:00:27.080 --> 00:00:29.660
converts. That's it. That's the story.

00:00:29.660 --> 00:00:31.440
I'm not gonna sit here and tell you what

00:00:31.440 --> 00:00:31.900
to do.

00:00:31.900 --> 00:00:33.160
The numbers already set it.
